{
  "_readme": "영어 축제 수동 교정(2026-09-30~, 영어 세션). TourAPI 영문 DB(festivals_en.json)는 매일 자동 갱신으로 덮이므로 교정은 여기에만 둔다. en-fix.js 가 build.js·festival-en.js 에서 적용. ko: {title,addr} = 지도 복사 칸 한글 원제·주소 지정, null = 좌표만 겹친 «다른 축제» 이름이 붙던 것을 숨김. 날짜는 주최측 공식 발표로만 고친다(src 필수). 공식 날짜가 TourAPI 영문과 같아지면 이 항목을 지운다.",
  "3310546": {"addr": "Citizens' Welfare Town Plaza (Donam-dong), Jeju-si, Jeju-do", "x": "126.5229397", "y": "33.4916992", "ko": {"title": "탐라문화제", "addr": "제주특별자치도 제주시 도남동 시민복지타운광장"}, "intro": {"place": "Citizens' Welfare Town Plaza area in Jeju City, plus venues across Jeju Island", "playtime": "", "fee": "", "program": "", "subevent": "", "host": "Jeju Special Self-Governing Province", "org": "Jeju Federation of Arts & Culture (Jeju Yechong)"}, "note": "The 65th Tamna Culture Festival runs Oct 17–21, 2026. The main venue has moved to Citizens' Welfare Town Plaza in Jeju City (in 2025 it was the Tapdong seafront). The opening ceremony is on Oct 17 at 7:30 pm, and this year the festival coincides with the National Sports Festival held in Jeju, so expect Jeju City to be busier than usual.", "src": "제주도 주최·제주예총 주관 발표 — 뉴스N제주 2026-09-20(idxno=300227), 국제뉴스 2026-09-08(idxno=3687960). 좌표: 시민복지타운광장(도남동 582) / 2026-10-14 TourAPI 가 날짜(10/17~21)를 따라잡아 start·end 교정 뺌"},
  "3307792": {
    "start": "20261009", "end": "20261011",
    "ko": { "title": "세종한글축제", "addr": "세종특별자치시 다솜로 216 (세종동)" },
    "note": "2026 marks the 100th anniversary of Hangeul Day, and the festival runs three days, Oct 9–11, 2026, at Sejong Central Park and Sejong Lake Park. A drone light show of about 2,000 drones is planned for the first night (Oct 9).",
    "src": "세종시 주최·세종시문화관광재단 주관 — 익스프레스뉴스 2026-09-09(idxno=329725). 한글판 TourAPI도 10/9~11"
  },
  "2588597": { "ko": { "title": "임실N치즈축제", "addr": "전북특별자치도 임실군 성수면 도인2길 50" }, "src": "좌표만 겹쳐 「임실N장미축제」가 붙던 것 교정. 한글판 TourAPI 2031318" },
  "1385298": {"ko": {"title": "부산불꽃축제", "addr": "부산광역시 수영구 광안해변로 219 (광안동)"}, "intro": {"fee": "Reserved seats (R / S) are paid", "playtime": ""}, "note": "The 21st Busan Fireworks Festival is on Saturday, Nov 7, 2026, over Gwangalli Beach, with the show also visible from the Igidae and Dongbaekseom areas. Paid seats (R seats with a table, S seats with a chair) are sold by the organizer through NOL Ticket; the early-bird batch sold out within a minute.", "src": "공식 busanfireworks.com 행사개요(제21회, 2026-11-07(토), 광안리해수욕장·이기대·동백섬 일원, 부산시 주최·부산축제조직위 주관). 뉴스핌 2026-09-04 유료석. 한글 원제는 「카운트다운 부산」이 붙던 것 교정(한글판 TourAPI 235076) / 2026-10-21 영어 세션: 클룩 171795 「Currently unavailable」, Creatrip 12948 「Reservations closed / Sold Out」 확인 → aff 제거"},
  "3536904": { "ko": { "title": "오슬로우 빈티지 마켓", "addr": "인천광역시 제물포구 제물량로218번길 3 (해안동1가)" }, "src": "「개항장 댕댕 도서관」이 붙던 것 교정. 한글판 TourAPI 3522322" },
  "3337796": { "ko": null, "src": "「대한민국불교문화엑스포」가 붙던 것 — 한글 원제 미확인이라 숨김" },
  "292632": { "ko": null, "src": "「고양가을꽃축제」가 붙던 것(국제꽃박람회와 다른 행사) — 숨김" },
  "3562124": { "ko": null, "src": "「광복로 겨울빛 트리축제」가 붙던 것(다른 시기 행사) — 숨김" },
  "1084180": {"intro": {"place": "Jeju Olle Routes 19 and 20 (Jocheon-eup to Gujwa-eup, Jeju-si)", "fee": "KRW 30,000; KRW 25,000 for groups of 20 or more, youth, people with disabilities and national merit recipients"}, "note": "The 2026 Jeju Olle Walking Festival runs Nov 5–7 on Olle Routes 19 and 20. Day 1: opening at Jocheon Sports Ground, then 13 km to Dongbok-ri Sports Park. Day 2: Dongbok-ri Sports Park to Jeju Batdam Theme Park (11.5 km). Day 3: Jeju Haenyeo Anti-Japanese Movement Memorial Park back to Jeju Batdam Theme Park (12.9 km). Pre-registration period: Jul 8 – Oct 9, 2026, in the official Olle Pass app — foreign visitors register in the same app. The organizers say this is the last edition in the three-day, one-route format; from 2027 the festival is planned to spread across 23 routes over 25 days.", "noteUntil": "20261107", "noteFoot": "Checked against two reports of the organizer's announcement (Seoul Shinmun 2026-07-08, Jnuri 2026-07). The participation fee appears in one of them only — confirm in the Olle Pass app.", "src": "서울신문 2026-07-08 (seoul.co.kr/news/society/2026/07/08/20260708500087) — 11/5~7·19·20코스·참가비·올레패스·10/9 마감·내년 25일 23코스 개편 / 제이누리 no=69060 — 11/5~7·일자별 구간(13·11.5·12.9km)·사전신청 7/8~10/9·외국인 같은 앱. 2026-10-06 영어 세션"},
  "3364856": {"intro": {"playtime": "9:00 am – 2:00 pm on each walk day"}, "note": "The walk is held on three separate days, not continuously: Sep 19 (Gapyeong, meeting at Gapyeong Station), Oct 10 (Pocheon, Hantangang River UNESCO Global Geopark) and Nov 7, 2026 (Chuncheon, meeting at Chuncheon Station). Each walk runs 9 am – 2 pm. It is free for ages 8 and up, with online registration on the Han River Watershed Management Committee website (hanriver.or.kr). Every participant gets a tote bag and a souvenir; finishing all three courses earns a completion badge.", "noteUntil": "20261107", "noteFoot": "Source: Han River Watershed Management Committee official event page, checked Oct 7, 2026.", "src": "hanriver.or.kr/ecology/20110_info.php (2026 한강수계 걷기행사: 9/19 가평역·10/10 한탄강 유네스코 지질공원·11/7 춘천역, 09~14시, 8세+, 무료, 통합생태체험시스템 신청) 2026-10-07 확인"},
  "1037621": {"note": "Pohang City has set the 2026 festival for Nov 19–21 around Yeongildae Beach — later than usual, because the early-summer slot clashed with the June local elections. Nov 19: a media-art lighting ceremony at Songdo Pier. Nov 20: a fireworks street parade with groups from all 29 town and neighborhood districts. Nov 21: the main fireworks show over Yeongildae Beach from 8 pm for about an hour, with teams from Korea, Japan and France and a finale by Korea's Hanwha. Road closures, shuttles and viewing areas had not been announced as of Oct 21, 2026.", "noteUntil": "20261121", "noteFoot": "Source: News1, Oct 19, 2026, citing Pohang City. Checked Oct 21, 2026.", "desc": "Nov 19–21, 2026 · Pohang. Main fireworks show Nov 21 from 8 pm over Yeongildae Beach (Korea, Japan, France, Hanwha finale); street parade Nov 20.", "src": "뉴스1 2026-10-19(스포탈코리아 idxno=2025052909553626445 게재) 「포항시 등에 따르면」 — 11/19 송도부두 미디어아트 점등, 11/20 불꽃 거리 퍼레이드(29개 읍면동), 11/21 20시 1시간 영일대해수욕장 불꽃쇼(한·일·프랑스+한화 피날레), 6월 지방선거로 연기. 관광공사 kfes 11/19~21 과 일치. 2026-10-21 영어 세션"},
  "790394": {"start": "20260905", "end": "20260905", "ko": {"title": "서울세계불꽃축제", "addr": "서울특별시 영등포구 여의동로 330 (여의도한강공원)"}, "src": "한화 발표 — 2026-09-05(토) 여의도 개최(다음뉴스 2026-08-06 「한화, 9월 5일 여의도서 ‘서울세계불꽃축제 2026’ 개최」, SBS Biz). 지도 칸 한글 원제가 좌표만으로 「서울스프링페스티벌」에 붙던 것 교정"},
  "2394700": {"ko": {"title": "전주 국가유산 야행", "addr": "전북특별자치도 전주시 완산구 태조로 44 (경기전)"}, "src": "지도 칸 한글 원제가 좌표만으로 「전주한옥마을 전통연희 퍼레이드-노상놀이야」에 붙던 것 교정. 2026 일정 10/2~3 경기전 일원(아이뉴스24 2026-10-01)"},
  "3115770": {"start": "20260103", "end": "20261231", "intro": {"playtime": "Every Saturday · 7:00 pm & 9:00 pm (Oct–Feb), 8:00 pm & 10:00 pm (Mar–Sep)"}, "note": "The drone show runs every Saturday night in 2026 over Gwangalli Beach, twice a night: 7:00 pm and 9:00 pm from October to February, and 8:00 pm and 10:00 pm from March to September. Shows can be canceled for bad weather or technical problems, so check the Busan city event page on the day before you head out.", "noteUntil": "20261231", "noteFoot": "Sources: Busan Metropolitan City event page; Sports Kyunghyang, Jul 3, 2026 (year-round operation contract). Checked Oct 14, 2026.", "desc": "Every Saturday in 2026 · Busan. Hundreds of drones light up Gwangalli Beach, 7 pm & 9 pm (Oct–Feb) or 8 pm & 10 pm (Mar–Sep). Weather can cancel a show.", "src": "부산시 busan.go.kr/eng/bsevents/1713160 (매주 토 2회, 3~9월 20·22시, 10~2월 19·21시) + 스포츠경향 2026-07-03(유비파이 2026-07-01~2027-06-30 상설 계약). TourAPI 20260101 하루 → 2026-01-03~12-31 매주 토 / 2026-10-21 영어 세션: Creatrip 15648 aff", "aff": {"until": "20261231", "url": "https://creatrip.com/en/spot/15648?utm_source=AFF-4ljv46f&aff_id=AFF-4ljv46f", "lead": "If you would rather watch from indoors, a private room facing Gwangan Bridge (for 1–2 people, with a drone-show viewing option; the room's operator does not run the show) is sold on Creatrip", "text": "See the Gwangan Bridge drone-show viewing room", "checked": "2026-10-21 creatrip spot 15648 열어 확인 — Bridge1006 Busan, 광안대교 오션뷰 개인 실내 공간 1~2인, 드론쇼 관람 옵션(약 12분+, 업체가 드론쇼 운영 안 함), 날짜 지정 티켓, 3일 전까지 무료 취소/변경, From 36.19 USD"}},
  "697445": {"addr": "Lotte Garden Park area (next to Lotte Premium Outlets Gimhae), Sinmun-dong, Gimhae-si, Gyeongsangnam-do", "x": "128.826623242068", "y": "35.183024156029", "ko": {"title": "김해분청도자기축제", "addr": "경상남도 김해시 신문동 1410 롯데가든파크 일원"}, "intro": {"place": "Lotte Garden Park area in Jangyu, Gimhae (next to Lotte Premium Outlets Gimhae)"}, "note": "The 31st edition runs Nov 6–10, 2026 and, for the first time in its 31 years, moves out of Jillye (the Buncheong Ceramics Museum area) to Lotte Garden Park next to Lotte Premium Outlets Gimhae in Jangyu. Expect potters' exhibitions and sales, clay-shaping workshops, a traditional kiln firing and large-scale pottery demonstrations. Shuttle and parking details had not been announced as of Oct 14, 2026, and older pages on the festival site still describe the Jillye venue.", "noteUntil": "20261110", "noteFoot": "Sources: official festival site main page (festival.buncheong.co.kr); Newspim and Gimhae Ilbo, Oct 12, 2026.", "desc": "Nov 6–10, 2026 · Gimhae. The Buncheong pottery festival moves to Lotte Garden Park in Jangyu this year: potters' market, clay workshops, a kiln firing.", "src": "festival.buncheong.co.kr 메인(2026 제31회 11/6~10 장유 롯데가든파크) + 뉴스핌·김해일보 2026-10-12. 좌표: 카카오 「롯데가든파크」 신문동 1410. 하위 페이지(오시는길)는 2025 진례 기준이라 안 씀"},
  "1373574": {"addr": "Gongjicheon Stream waterfront (586 Onui-dong), Chuncheon-si, Gangwon-do", "ko": {"title": "춘천막국수닭갈비축제", "addr": "강원특별자치도 춘천시 온의동 586 (공지천 일원)"}, "src": "mdfestival.com + 파이낸셜뉴스 2026-10-13(11시~21시 주문마감, 6,900/9,900원) + 강원도민일보 idxno=2077787(국제존 6개 도시) + 비건뉴스 392434(수변무대 19~21시, 출렁다리 주차장↔춘천KBS 30분 셔틀) / 2026-10-21 영어 세션: 축제 끝(10/18) → note·desc 정리, 주소·한글 원제만 유지"},
  "1853185": {"note": "The 23rd Iksan Chrysanthemum Festival (billed as 'Ten Million Chrysanthemums') runs Oct 23 – Nov 1, 2026 at Jungang Sports Park, Sinheung Neighborhood Park and around Iksan Station; the chrysanthemum sculptures stay on display until Nov 8. After dark there are interactive light installations and a chrysanthemum light tunnel, with EDM parties and circus shows planned for the evenings and fireworks on Oct 31. A sweet-potato zone lets children dig up and carry sweet potatoes. Opening hours, admission and parking were not given in the city's announcement.", "noteUntil": "20261101", "noteFoot": "Source: Inews24, Oct 14, 2026 (Iksan City press conference). Checked Oct 21, 2026.", "desc": "Oct 23 – Nov 1, 2026 · Iksan. Chrysanthemum displays at Jungang Sports Park and around Iksan Station, a light tunnel at night and fireworks on Oct 31.", "src": "아이뉴스24 2026-10-14 inews24.com/view/2014943 (익산시 기자회견: 제23회 10/23~11/1 중앙체육공원·신흥근린공원·익산역 일원, 조형물 11/8까지, 야간 인터랙티브 조명·국화빛 터널, EDM·동춘서커스, 10/31 불꽃, 고구마 놀이터). 2026-10-21 영어 세션"},
  "1244634": {"note": "The 26th Masan Gagopa Chrysanthemum Festival runs Oct 31 – Nov 8, 2026, and admission is free. This year it spreads along the waterfront across three areas: 3·15 Marine Nuri Park (about 100,000 chrysanthemum pots), Happo Waterfront Park and Masan Marine New Town. Its signature piece is a single chrysanthemum plant trained to carry 1,540 blooms, a Guinness World Record. The opening night starts with fireworks, and on the evening of Nov 4 a nakhwa ('falling fire') show is held over the sea for the first time, with more than 1,500 hanging fire sticks burning for about an hour. Changwon City provides about 5,500 parking spaces across the three sites and a free shuttle from Masan Station, but the weekday shuttle stops at 6 pm.", "noteUntil": "20261108", "noteFoot": "Source: Maeil Shinmun, Oct 16, 2026. Checked Oct 21, 2026.", "desc": "Oct 31 – Nov 8, 2026 · Changwon (Masan). Free chrysanthemum festival on the waterfront; first nakhwa fire show over the sea Nov 4. Free shuttle from Masan Stn.", "src": "매일신문 2026-10-16 imaeil.com/page/view/2026101607051923639 (제26회 10/31~11/8 무료, 3·15해양누리공원·합포수변공원·해양신도시, 국화 10만 본, 다륜대작 1천540송이 기네스, 개막 불꽃쇼, 11/4 해상 낙화놀이 낙화봉 1,500개+ 1시간, 주차 5,500면, 마산역 무료 셔틀 평일 18시 종료). 2026-10-21 영어 세션"},
  "3566502": {"ko": null, "src": "지도 칸 한글 원제가 좌표만으로 「서울국제불교박람회」에 붙던 것 — 다른 행사라 숨김(2026-10-21 영어 세션)"},
  "293214": {"ko": null, "src": "지도 칸 한글 원제가 좌표만으로 「홍천 사과축제」에 붙던 것 — 다른 행사라 숨김(2026-10-21 영어 세션)"},
  "3396183": {"note": "On Oct 31, 2026 the fireworks move to the Yeosu Expo site (Deokchung-dong, next to Yeosu-EXPO Station), which is a side venue of the 2026 Yeosu World Island Expo. An overseas pyrotechnics team stages an island-themed show. On the day, extra shuttle buses run between the Island Expo main venue (Dolsan Jinmo area) and Yeosu-EXPO Station; the city asks visitors to check the official festival site for show times, traffic control and parking.", "noteUntil": "20261031", "noteFoot": "Sources: Yeosu City announcement as reported by Jeonguk Maeil Sinmun (Oct 25, 2026) and Namhaean Sinmun (Oct 26, 2026). Checked Oct 28, 2026.", "desc": "Oct 31, 2026 · Yeosu. Night fireworks over the sea at the Yeosu Expo site, next to Yeosu-EXPO Station. Extra shuttle buses run on the day.", "src": "jeonmae.co.kr idxno=1304655 (2026-10-25: 31일 덕충동 여수세계박람회장, 섬박람회 부행사장, 진모지구 제외, 섬박람회 주행사장↔여수엑스포역 셔틀 증차, 교통·주차는 누리집) + nhanews.com idxno=93831 (2026-10-26: 해외 연출팀 '섬' 주제, 안전인력 570여 명). 시간은 기사에 없어 안 씀. 2026-10-28 영어 세션"},
  "3547117": {"ko": null, "src": "지도 칸 한글 원제가 좌표만으로 「홍성 국가유산야행」에 붙던 것 — 다른 행사라 숨김(2026-10-21 영어 세션)"},
  "3554627": {"ko": null, "src": "「DDP 어린이 디자인 페스티벌」이 좌표만으로 붙음(다른 행사) — 숨김. 2026-10-28 영어 세션"},
  "1398781": {"desc": "Nov 4–8, 2026 · Cheongsong. The 20th Cheongsong Apple Festival along Yongjeoncheon Stream in Cheongsong-eup, at the peak of apple harvest season.", "src": "경북매일 2026-09-28 article/20260928500366 (11/4~8 청송읍 용전천 일원, 주제 「지금 청송! 사과로 물들다」) + 2026-10-18 article/20261018500281 (제20회). 2026-10-28 영어 세션"}
}
